{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他很珍惜和对方待在一起，想得到以后也不会变的保证，却开始害怕对方有一天不再需要自己。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"幸福、珍惜、患得患失、害怕失去、隐约悲伤\",\n      \"missed\": \"从最初怕自己的需要给对方添负担，到现在怕对方不再需要自己，这个心理变化需要读下方粗体段落才能完整理解；中间关于幸福里掺进悲伤的解释，以及右侧情绪变化的完整顺序也不容易一眼抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他越来越喜欢和对方相处，想相信这份亲密能一直持续，却因为害怕失去对方而开始犹豫要不要收起自己的心意。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"甜蜜、依恋、不安、害怕被嫌弃、矛盾、心疼\",\n      \"missed\": \"为什么他会从害怕给对方添负担，变成害怕自己不再被需要，以及为什么隐藏心意反而让自己更难受，需要逐句读才能串起来。右侧的小字情绪阶段不容易完整扫到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他正处在一段让自己幸福又不安的亲密关系里，越来越舍不得对方，也越来越害怕有一天这份需要和喜欢不再被回应。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"幸福、心动、依恋、患得患失、忧伤、挣扎\",\n      \"missed\": \"刚握到手里却发现留不住的比喻，以及下方脚步不动、上方声音不断下落的画面，需要读小字才能理解；右侧从不敢表达喜欢到不再隐藏喜欢的变化也不容易一次看全。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"最影响扫读的是下方醒目的粗体段落虽然突出，但一段里塞进了好几层心理转折：怕给对方添负担、怕对方不再需要自己、想少表达心意、隐藏起来反而更难受。紫色突出的问题和结尾能抓住情绪，却没有让中间的因果关系一眼显现。右侧情绪词与正文大体对应，但字号较小、条数较多。下方金色音符线条有音乐流动感，却没有明确对应人物处境。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e9557bbb-2b94-47b3-ba58-dbdaa7b64b73", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T224452811730Z", "elapsed_seconds": 53.907, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T22:45:46.724805+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "916ab37b653d482ffd51105dee5c25332f225b17aac8063c3d2094ab2c7e6033", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T224452811730Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "f66070ea81aac7e47084d787c256a74da46a13a732eea106b1428621c0a41249"}}}
